<title>INDONESIA: Bayu Q1 net up sharply to 4.25 bln rph.</title>
<headline>Bayu Q1 net up sharply to 4.25 bln rph.</headline>
<dateline>JAKARTA 1997-06-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Three months to March 31, 1997</p>
<p>		     (in billion rupiah unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit				   4.25   vs  2.10</p>
<p>    Revenue				     85.02   vs 70.80</p>
<p>    Operating profit			   5.22   vs  2.02</p>
<p>    Gross profit				26.06  vs  17.73</p>
<p>    Total assets			     332.39  vs  259.67</p>
<p>NOTE: The results were consolidated. PT Bayu Buana is a tourism services firm. -- Jakarta newsroom +6221 384-6364</p>
</text>
